  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/itssmudgy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/2a9df7a0-e76e-449b-89d8-e5c5422dead7.webp\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></p><section>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hVcqt4vzbu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons/webp/discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"28\"></a>ᅟ<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fitssmudgy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-F16061?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hEzgIwf.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h2>\n<p>此模組是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colored_water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ColoredWater</a>（作者：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/cozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cozary</a>）的擴充附加組件。本模組新增了彩色熔岩，讓您能隨心所欲地裝飾您的世界。此外，也包含了暗淡彩色熔岩，這是不會發光的彩色熔岩變體。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_346af96c-245c-4a00-b713-df45a76df81c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p><strong>合成方式：</strong></p>\n<p>合成既直觀又簡單。您只需取得一桶熔岩和一種染料即可。而暗淡彩色熔岩則需要額外一種染料才能製作！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a4827793-28cd-4808-b8bc-aa7fcc29dbb5.png\" width=\"381\" height=\"214\"></p>\n</div>\n</section>",
